# 2. TARGET USERS

Flota must support these user groups:

- Beginners who have never written code.
- Freelancers who create websites for clients.
- Small-business owners who need business websites.
- Developers who want to accelerate their work.
- Users who need complete source code and control over their projects.

The interface must not assume that every user understands technical terminology.

Advanced functionality should remain available without making the default interface confusing.

