# 24. FINAL PRODUCT GOAL

Flota must become a reliable, approachable, AI-powered website development assistant that allows users to describe what they want, collaborate through text or voice, receive a tailored website implementation, inspect and test its code, recover their work, and obtain a deployable project.

The initial Android release must establish a secure and maintainable foundation before advanced functionality is added.

Prioritize correctness, maintainability, privacy, predictable behavior, and a clear user experience over the number of advertised features.

**End of PRD — Version 1.0**
